Proposed arduino-pico fix for USB NCM when the host leaves the data interface at alt 0 (see arduino_pico.md).
Copy libraries/lwIP_USB_NCM and libraries/tusb-ncm from the framework package into DIR/libraries, run `patch -p1`
in DIR, and build usbncm-patched.yaml with `-s ncm_libs DIR/libraries`.

